      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "💎 Guide: Full-Quality 25-Step 360° VR Panorama (2K)",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 💎 Qwen 360 Full Quality Panorama Studio (4K Bilateral Pipeline)\n\nPristine 25-step production generation + **4K RealESRGAN 2×** + **Subtle Bilateral Cleanup**.\n\n### 🔄 Full Pipeline\n1. **Text/Image Conditioning**: Pano360 LoRA spherical backbone.\n2. **25-step Euler Sampling**: High-precision denoising for crisp architectural & landscape geometry.\n3. **4K Toroidal Upscale**: RealESRGAN 2× with 5% boundary wrap.\n4. **Subtle Bilateral Filter**: Mild d=5, sigmaColor=15 edge-preserving noise cleanup.\n5. **VR 360 Viewer & Export**: Interactive WebGL sphere viewer + Photo Sphere XMP metadata."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# 🌐 Qwen-Image-2.1 • Full-Quality 360° VR Panorama\n\nProduction high-fidelity spherical skybox & VR environment!\n\n• **Model**: `qwen_image_2.1_Q5_K_M.gguf` (Zero LoRAs — pure native base DiT math)\n• **QwenImage21Cache**: Prefix attention caching accelerates 25-step inference to ~60-80s on 8GB GPU!\n• **Sampler**: Native `euler` / `simple` at **25 steps**\n• **CFG Guidance Knob**: Default `1.0` (fast single-pass). You can increase to `2.0 - 3.0` to strongly amplify prompt adherence.\n• **Resolution**: Choose `1536x768` (2:1) or `1568x672` (21:9 Ultrawide), followed by instant upscale to 2K.\n• **Interactive 360 Viewer**: Drag to look around in 360°, scroll to zoom FOV, or toggle auto-rotation."
      },
      "color": "#322",
      "bgcolor": "#533"
    },
